From: Byben <heybyben@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 14:20:24 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 28/32] Launcher3: QuickSpace: rename cr_* res files to
 quickspace_*

Drop crDroid branding from resource filenames; move the pinned
container id into id.xml and drop cr_config.xml.

Change-Id: Icb7fa52717b61da939c41c8c6f0dad50343697bb
---
 .../{cr_dimens.xml => quickspace_dimens.xml}  |  0
 res/values/cr_config.xml                      | 21 -------------------
 res/values/id.xml                             |  2 ++
 .../{cr_arrays.xml => quickspace_arrays.xml}  |  0
 ...{cr_strings.xml => quickspace_strings.xml} |  0
 .../{cr_styles.xml => quickspace_styles.xml}  |  0
 6 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)
 rename quickstep/res/values/{cr_dimens.xml => quickspace_dimens.xml} (100%)
 delete mode 100644 res/values/cr_config.xml
 rename res/values/{cr_arrays.xml => quickspace_arrays.xml} (100%)
 rename res/values/{cr_strings.xml => quickspace_strings.xml} (100%)
 rename res/values/{cr_styles.xml => quickspace_styles.xml} (100%)

diff --git a/quickstep/res/values/cr_dimens.xml b/quickstep/res/values/quickspace_dimens.xml
similarity index 100%
rename from quickstep/res/values/cr_dimens.xml
rename to quickstep/res/values/quickspace_dimens.xml
